--- !u!114 &1421919406
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1421919405}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 445e13603f407004589a4378f99edb2c, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DersNotu
  dersBasligi: "Mod\xFCl 2 | Ders 4 | Zaman Y\xF6netimi"
  amac: "Bu sahne dersin ba\u015F\u0131ndaki durumdur. Betikler eklenmi\u015Ftir.
    Top havada bekler, d\xFC\u015F\xFCrmek i\xE7in Rigidbody bile\u015Feninde Is
    Kinematic kutusunu kapat\u0131n.\n\nYan yana iki k\xFCp d\xF6nd\xFCr\xFCyoruz.
    Soldaki k\xFCp her karede sabit a\xE7\u0131yla, sa\u011Fdaki k\xFCp Time.deltaTime
    ile \xE7arp\u0131larak d\xF6ner. Kare h\u0131z\u0131n\u0131 ve zaman \xF6l\xE7e\u011Fini
    tu\u015Flarla de\u011Fi\u015Ftirip iki k\xFCp aras\u0131ndaki fark\u0131 izliyoruz.
    Sonra bir topu d\xFC\u015F\xFCrerek sabit zaman ad\u0131m\u0131n\u0131 ve enterpolasyonu
    g\xF6r\xFCyoruz."
  adimlar:
  - "Ders04_Baslangic sahnesini a\xE7\u0131n. HareketSabit ve HareketDelta betiklerini
    a\xE7\u0131p kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131n. Game penceresinde Stats
    d\xFC\u011Fmesini a\xE7\u0131n ve Play tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n. FPS 60 iken iki
    k\xFCp ayn\u0131 h\u0131zda d\xF6ner."
  - "Game penceresine t\u0131klay\u0131n ve 2 tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n. Hedef kare
    h\u0131z\u0131 15 olur. Soldaki k\xFCp yava\u015Flar, sa\u011Fdaki k\xFCp ayn\u0131
    h\u0131zda d\xF6nmeye devam eder."
  - "1 tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n. Kare h\u0131z\u0131 s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131 kalkar.
    Soldaki k\xFCp \xE7ok h\u0131zlan\u0131r, sa\u011Fdaki k\xFCp yine ayn\u0131
    h\u0131zda d\xF6ner."
  - "P tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n. Zaman \xF6l\xE7e\u011Fi 0 olur. Sa\u011Fdaki k\xFCp
    durur, soldaki k\xFCp d\xF6nmeye devam eder. Tekrar P tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n."
  - "S tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n. Zaman \xF6l\xE7e\u011Fi 0.25 olur. Hierarchy'de Top
    nesnesini se\xE7in ve Rigidbody bile\u015Feninde Is Kinematic kutusunu kapat\u0131n.
    Top a\u011F\u0131r \xE7ekimde d\xFC\u015Fer. Normal h\u0131za d\xF6nmek i\xE7in
    P tu\u015Funa iki kez bas\u0131n. \u0130lk bas\u0131\u015F oyunu durdurur, ikincisi
    devam ettirir."
  - "Play modundan \xE7\u0131k\u0131n. Edit men\xFCs\xFCnden Project Settings, Time
    b\xF6l\xFCm\xFCn\xFC a\xE7\u0131n. Fixed Timestep 0.02 ve Maximum Allowed Timestep
    0.3333 de\u011Ferlerini bulun. Fixed Timestep de\u011Ferini 0.1 yap\u0131n. Top
    nesnesinde Is Kinematic kutusunu bu kez Play modu kapal\u0131yken kapat\u0131n."
  - "Play tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n. Top kesik kesik d\xFC\u015Fer. Play modundan \xE7\u0131k\u0131n
    ve Fixed Timestep de\u011Ferini yeniden 0.02 yap\u0131n. Topun Rigidbody bile\u015Feninde
    Interpolate ayar\u0131n\u0131 Interpolate yap\u0131n ve Play tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n.
    D\xFC\u015F\xFC\u015F art\u0131k p\xFCr\xFCzs\xFCzd\xFCr."
  kendinDene:
  - "HareketSabit beti\u011Findeki 1.5 de\u011Ferini 90 ile Time.deltaTime \xE7arp\u0131m\u0131yla
    de\u011Fi\u015Ftirin. \u0130ki k\xFCp art\u0131k her kare h\u0131z\u0131nda ayn\u0131
    m\u0131 d\xF6n\xFCyor?"
  - "S tu\u015Fundan sonra Stats panelindeki FPS de\u011Ferine bak\u0131n. Zaman
    \xF6l\xE7e\u011Fi kare h\u0131z\u0131n\u0131 de\u011Fi\u015Ftiriyor mu?"
  - "Fixed Timestep de\u011Ferini 0.005 yap\u0131n ve topu d\xFC\u015F\xFCr\xFCn.
    Hareket nas\u0131l g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCyor? Denemeden sonra de\u011Feri 0.02 yapmay\u0131
    unutmay\u0131n."
